Z||000004||Songman||05-20-2001||11:01 PM||||We have almost 20 people statewide. Still haven't met all of them yet but we are brand new and getting more people interested everyday. Hope we can add you to that list. Feel free to sign up for the mailing list at at website and start talking to everyone....<P>I think we are planning to get as many people as possible together for the All-Pontiac show in Pigeon Forge in June. Hope you can come join us there as well.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/songman_1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://members.home.com/tnfieros" TARGET=_blank>Tennessee Fiero Owners</A>||||reg||1
Z||000005||Bob Englert||05-20-2001||11:07 PM||||Hey Songman, several NC Fiero owners will be going to Pigeon Forge.  Jack Cooke will be entering the show in his very nice gold 86GT.  I plan to drive over with him but I don't plan to enter the show, the car is not in show condition.  We might have a couple more NC owners as well.<P>I know Kendall Bowers from Greeneville, TN will be there as well.  <P>We are planing to drive over Saturday morning.  I am planning to stay somewhere in Knoxville and drive through Deal's Gap Sunday morning.<P>We will look for you.  Wear your Fiero name badge!<P><P>------------------<BR>Bob<BR>2 - 87 GT's<BR>85 SE 4 cyl||||reg||1
