Z||000007||Songman||05-21-2001||07:25 PM||||Hey Bob...<P>We'll look for you in Pigeon Forge. Not sure which car I will be driving yet, but not entering anyway.. Just coming to look around and meet people.<P>All of us in the club have name badges with our TN Fiero logo on them so look for us! <P>Wish I was gonna be in Knoxville so I could run the Gap with you!<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/songman_1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://members.home.com/tnfieros" TARGET=_blank>Tennessee Fiero Owners</A>||||reg||14
