Z||000010||Songman||05-22-2001||08:30 AM||||The dates are June 15-16.<P>This is the 1st Annual Southeastern Regional Pontiac/Oakland Show, being called Pontiacs in Pigeon Forge. Pretty cool to have a dash plaque from the first one.<P>For more info...<BR> <A HREF="http://smokymtnpontiacs.com/pigeon.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://smokymtnpontiacs.com/pigeon.htm</A> <P>Allan, I've got a condo and a cabin over there. We'll talk about it later.<P>Hey Ronnie, you and the guys come on up. Everybody come! We'll all get together for a Fiero convoy over the Smokies or out to Cades Cove or something....<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/songman_1.gif">  <BR><A HREF="http://members.home.com/tnfieros" TARGET=_blank>Tennessee Fiero Owners</A><p>[This message has been edited by Songman (edited 05-22-2001).]||||reg||1
